   <ti type="ul">View the files of several folders in one piece</ti>
    <ti type="ul">()Specify the number of directory-levels you want to include in that 'one-piece-view'()</ti>  
    <ti type="ul">See file-statistics per extension</ti>
    <ti type="ul">()See file-statistics per category, a group of extensions() </ti>
    <ti type="ul">Arrange and specify these categories yourself</ti>
     <ti type="ul">Filter files per extension(e:s) category or size</ti>
    <ti type="ul">()Analyze File-Content (eg. Tabs of calculation sheets or xml-robot jobs)()</ti>
    <ti type="ul">Apply operations on files</ti>
    <ti type="ul">Apply operations on directories</ti>
    <ti type="ul">Write your own operations and implement them as scripts</ti>
    <ti type="ul">Write your own operations and implement them as scripts</ti>
  </ti>
 
  <ti type="img" x="(dir,app)pano-introduction.png" test="(f,not,(f,implement,online))"/>
